list.item:

    Royall, Kenneth C., Under
Secretary of War, November 1945–July 1947;
Secretary of War, July 1947–September 1947;
Secretary of the Army from September 1947

person.note:
Deputy Chief of Staff (Policy) to the British Military Governor for Germany;
                    from November 1947, Chief of Staff and Deputy Military Governor of the British
                    Zone in Germany

Deputy Under Secretary of State (Political), British Foreign Office;
                    Superintending Under Secretary of the German Department, February 1946–December
                    1947

Deputy Commander-in-Chief of British Forces of Occupation in Germany; Deputy
                    British Military Governor for Germany, August 1945–October 1947;
                    Commander-in-Chief and Military Governor from November 1947
